# Phase 5 gap-fill

When editing reconnect / collision:

1. Prefer **one named gap**: vsec completeness, same-layer under/span plates, strip preserving bridges, or air-column/nuke thrash — not all at once.
2. Under-plate origin must be flush (`_brick_bottom_y`) — never embed plates inside brick AABB.
3. Strip must not delete plates required for single-section connectivity.
4. After changes, run `python -m phase5.demo_sphere` (locked diameter 16). Must exit 0 with 1 section / 0 collisions.
5. Do not bump `BASELINE_DIAMETER_STUDS` in the same PR/session as a speculative reconnect rewrite.
